<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Thank You for Your Donation!</title>
  <style>
    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');
    
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      width: 100% !important;
      background-color: #0b0f19;
      font-family: 'Outfit', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }
    
    .wrapper {
      width: 100%;
      table-layout: fixed;
      background-color: #0b0f19;
      padding-bottom: 40px;
      padding-top: 40px;
    }
    
    .main-table {
      background-color: #111827;
      margin: 0 auto;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 600px;
      border-spacing: 0;
      color: #f3f4f6;
      border-radius: 16px;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3), 0 10px 10px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    }
    
    .header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981 0%, #059669 100%);
      padding: 40px 30px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    
    .header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #ffffff;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }
    
    .content {
      padding: 40px 30px;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    
    .greeting {
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-top: 0;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      color: #ffffff;
    }
    
    .message {
      color: #9ca3af;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .receipt-card {
      background-color: #1f2937;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    }

    .receipt-title {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #10b981;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      margin-top: 0;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .receipt-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .receipt-row:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      padding-top: 12px;
    }

    .receipt-label {
      color: #9ca3af;
    }

    .receipt-value {
      color: #ffffff;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .receipt-value.highlight {
      color: #10b981;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 18px;
    }
    
    .footer {
      background-color: #0d121f;
      padding: 24px 30px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #6b7280;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    }
    
    .footer a {
      color: #10b981;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <center class="wrapper">
    <table class="main-table" width="100%">
      <tr>
        <td class="header">
          <h1>Donation Confirmed!</h1>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="content">
          <p class="greeting">Dear <%= name %>,</p>
          <p class="message">
            Thank you so much for your generosity. Your contribution makes a real difference and helps us continue building and expanding our platform. We appreciate your support!
          </p>
          
          <div class="receipt-card">
            <h3 class="receipt-title">Donation Details</h3>
            <table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
              <tr>
                <td style="padding: 6px 0; color: #9ca3af; font-size: 15px;">Donation ID:</td>
                <td style="padding: 6px 0; color: #ffffff; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; text-align: right;"><%= donationId %></td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td style="padding: 6px 0; color: #9ca3af; font-size: 15px;">Currency:</td>
                <td style="padding: 6px 0; color: #ffffff; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; text-align: right;">EGP</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);">
                <td style="padding: 12px 0 0 0; color: #9ca3af; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600;">Total Amount:</td>
                <td style="padding: 12px 0 0 0; color: #10b981; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; text-align: right;"><%= amount %> EGP</td>
              </tr>
            </table>
          </div>
          
          <p class="message" style="font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: center;">
            Please keep this email for your records. If you have any questions, feel free to reply directly to this email.
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="footer">
          <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;">&copy; 2026 Our Platform. All rights reserved.</p>
          <p style="margin: 0;">Support reference: <%= donationId %></p>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </center>
</body>
</html>
